---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ParticleBackground from '../components/ParticleBackground.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy — StarSync" description="How StarSync handles your data, in plain language." hideTopbar hideFooter>
  <ParticleBackground slot="background" />

  <section class="card">
    <div class="card-header">
      <a href="/" class="logo-link">
        <img src="/starsync-logo-dark.svg" alt="StarSync" width="112" height="23" class="logo" />
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="back-link">Home</a>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy">
      <h1>Privacy, in plain language</h1>
      <p class="lede">No legal-speak. Here's exactly what we collect, why, and what we do — and don't do — with it.</p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>At signup: your name, email, date of birth, time of birth, place of birth, your role
      (engineering, design, student, etc.), and the time you want your daily email. That's it —
      no location tracking, no social profiles, no browsing history.</p>

      <h2>Why we need it</h2>
      <p>Your date, time, and place of birth are used <strong>once</strong>, at signup, to calculate
      your rasi (moon sign) and nakshatra — using open astronomical formulas that run entirely on our
      own server, not a third-party astrology service. We store the result of that calculation, not
      your raw coordinates. Your role is used to make the daily content actually relevant to your day
      instead of generic.</p>

      <h2>How it's protected</h2>
      <p>Your birth details are encrypted (AES-256-GCM) the moment they reach our server, before
      they're ever written to a database. The decryption key lives only in our server's secret
      store — there's no dashboard, admin panel, or support tool that can display your decrypted
      information. It's decrypted automatically, in memory, only at the moment your daily email is
      generated, and never logged or persisted in decrypted form. No one on our team can casually
      "look up" your birth chart, because there's nothing built that lets us.</p>

      <h2>What we don't do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We don't sell or share your data with advertisers or data brokers.</li>
        <li>We don't have astrologers or humans reviewing your birth details.</li>
        <li>We don't use your data to train any AI model.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Trying a reading before you subscribe</h2>
      <p>You can see a free reading on the site itself before giving us your email at all. Your
      birth details for that preview are used only in memory, to compute your chart, and never
      stored — nothing links that preview back to you. We do briefly keep a hashed (not raw) record
      of your IP address, only to enforce the 3-free-tries-per-day limit, and only for that day.</p>

      <h2>Payments</h2>
      <p>Payments and UPI Autopay / card mandates are handled entirely by Razorpay, a licensed
      payment processor. We never see or store your full card number or UPI PIN — Razorpay passes
      us only a subscription status.</p>

      <h2>Deleting your data</h2>
      <p>Unsubscribing — from any email we send, in one click — cancels your subscription
      immediately and deletes your personal data from our systems right away. We keep a minimal,
      anonymized billing record only as long as accounting/tax rules require, never your birth
      details.</p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>Reach out any time at <a href="mailto:privacy@familyfirstapps.com">privacy@familyfirstapps.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .card {
      /* Same scoped light-theme treatment as the homepage card — flips
         just this card to a light theme without touching the dark global
         :root values other pages still use. */
      --bg: #ffffff;
      --text: #121212;
      --text-muted: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.64);
      --border: #e4e3ec;
      color: var(--text);

      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 20vh auto 60px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
      backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 40px;
      box-shadow: 0 30px 80px -40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }

    .card-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .logo-link {
      display: flex;
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .logo {
      display: block;
      height: 20px;
      width: auto;
    }
    .back-link {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .privacy h1 {
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.2rem);
    }
    .lede {
      margin-top: 14px;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }
    .privacy h2 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-top: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .privacy p,
    .privacy li {
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }
    .privacy ul {
      padding-left: 20px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .card {
        padding: 28px 20px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</Base>
